        "description": "Brave News articles (up to 50 per page): title, URL, source, date, description, thumbnail. Pass `next_page` back as `page`. Every response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/brave-news",
        "tags": [
          "Brave"
        ],
        "x-credits": 1,
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "q",
            "in": "query",
